# Frontend SPA

- HTTP: `apiFetch` in `src/api/client.ts` (Bearer + `credentials: "include"`). Auth bootstrap uses raw fetch in `src/api/auth.ts` (no interceptor loop).
- Access JWT in memory only; refresh via httpOnly cookie. OpenAPI types from `src/api/generated/schema.ts` — do not hand-edit; regen with `npm run gen:api`.
- Server state: TanStack Query hooks under `src/api/hooks/`. Auth session: `AuthContext` (not Query cache).
- Guards: `RequireAuth` → `RequireStatus` → `RequireRole` in `AppRoot` / routing components.
- IG expiry → `INSTAGRAM_TOKEN_EXPIRED` / reconnect latch → `/reconnect-instagram` (public).
- Styling: Tailwind + `src/theme/palette.ts`. No Firebase (legacy unused).
- Behavior: [`PRODUCT.md`](PRODUCT.md). As-built: [`ARCHITECTURE.md`](ARCHITECTURE.md). Agent map: [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).
